 34CL c  1987Fu11,1987Or02: a 35-MeV proton beam was provided from the          
 34CL2c  AVF-cyclotron and a beam swinger system at Tohoku University. The      
 34CL3c  target was 2.64-mg/cm{+2}, 94.4%-enriched {+34}S evaporated on         
 34CL4c  99.9%-enriched {+12}C foils covered by thin gold. Measured |s(E{-n},|q)
 34CL5c  and analyzed with microscopic DWBA. Deduced level, L, J, and |p.       
 34CL c  2002Or05,1999OrZZ,1997Jo08: a 35-MeV proton beam was provided from the 
 34CL2c  AVF-cyclotron and a beam swinger system at Tohoku University. Targets  
 34CL3c  were prepared by evaporating {+34}S onto enriched {+12}C foils.        
 34CL4c  Neutrons were detected using 10 organic liquid scintillator NE213.     
 34CL5c  Measured |s(E{-n},|q) and analyzed with microscopic and macroscopic    
 34CL6c  DWBA. Deduced B(GT).                                                   
